@page "/ai"

<PageTitle>AI // The Singularity Workshop</PageTitle>

<div class="ai-workshop">
    <header class="ai-hero">
        <div class="ai-kicker">THE SINGULARITY WORKSHOP // AI</div>
        <h1>Teach the machine to speak in machines.</h1>
        <p>
            The interesting problem isn't making an AI talk.
            It's giving probabilistic intelligence a deterministic boundary it cannot casually break.
        </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-label="Live AI exchange">
        <AiExchangePanel />
    </section>

    <section class="ai-pipeline" aria-label="Workshop AI architecture">
        <article class="ai-card protocol">
            <div class="ai-index">01</div>
            <div class="ai-title">PROTOCOL AI</div>
            <div class="ai-subtitle">What can the machine say?</div>
            <p>
                Defines the vocabulary of operations available to the intelligence:
                commands, arguments, identifiers, values, and the machine-facing protocol.
            </p>
            <div class="ai-terminal">LLM → protocol vocabulary</div>
        </article>

        <div class="ai-arrow">→</div>

        <article class="ai-card grammar">
            <div class="ai-index">02</div>
            <div class="ai-title">GRAMMAR AI</div>
            <div class="ai-subtitle">How may it be assembled?</div>
            <p>
                Constrains the shape of valid instructions before they reach execution.
                Ambiguous language becomes structured machine intent.
            </p>
            <div class="ai-terminal">protocol → valid structure</div>
        </article>

        <div class="ai-arrow">→</div>

        <article class="ai-card command">
            <div class="ai-index">03</div>
            <div class="ai-title">COMMAND AI</div>
            <div class="ai-subtitle">What does the machine actually do?</div>
            <p>
                Turns the structured result into deterministic operations against real tools,
                state, data, applications, and runtimes.
            </p>
            <div class="ai-terminal">grammar → deterministic execution</div>
        </article>

        <div class="ai-arrow">→</div>

        <article class="ai-card app">
            <div class="ai-index">04</div>
            <div class="ai-title">APP AI</div>
            <div class="ai-subtitle">What if the application itself is the artifact?</div>
            <p>
                The next obvious boundary: an AI receives a goal, derives the application
                required to accomplish it, and assembles that application from deterministic constructs.
            </p>
            <div class="ai-terminal">goal → application → execution</div>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="ai-boundary">
        <div class="boundary-label">THE BOUNDARY</div>
        <div class="boundary-flow">
            <span>PROBABILISTIC</span>
            <strong>LLM</strong>
            <span class="boundary-line"></span>
            <strong>PROTOCOL</strong>
            <span class="boundary-line"></span>
            <strong>GRAMMAR</strong>
            <span class="boundary-line"></span>
            <strong>COMMAND</strong>
            <span class="boundary-line"></span>
            <span>DETERMINISTIC</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            The Workshop is interested in the boundary itself: how much freedom can intelligence have
            while the machine remains predictable, inspectable, and testable?
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="ai-observability">
        <div>
            <div class="ai-kicker">WHY THIS BELONGS HERE</div>
            <h2>Every layer should be able to expose its own machinery.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-data-grid">
            <div><span>STATE</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
            <div><span>CONTEXT</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
            <div><span>TRANSITIONS</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
            <div><span>COMMANDS</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
            <div><span>DATA</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
            <div><span>PERFORMANCE</span><strong>VISIBLE</strong></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="ai-footer">
        <span>THE WORKSHOP IS BUILDING THE TOOLS THAT BUILD THE TOOLS.</span>
        <span>APP AI // EMERGING CONSTRUCT</span>
    </footer>
</div>

<style>
    .ai-workshop {
        min-height: calc(100vh - 5rem);
        margin: -1rem -1.5rem;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #eafcff;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 18% 20%, rgba(0,234,255,.08), transparent 28%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 82% 72%, rgba(255,44,255,.07), transparent 30%),
            #020711;
        font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    .ai-hero { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); text-align: center; }
    .ai-kicker { color: #00eaff; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .ai-hero h1 { margin: .8rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.8rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.04em; text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,234,255,.22); }
    .ai-hero p { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; color: #9ebac5; font-size: clamp(.9rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem); line-height: 1.7; }

    .ai-pipeline { display: flex; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; gap: clamp(.4rem, 1.3vw, 1.4rem); max-width: 1600px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .ai-card { position: relative; flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; padding: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem); border: 1px solid rgba(0,234,255,.25); background: rgba(3,12,24,.78); box-shadow: inset 0 0 28px rgba(0,234,255,.025), 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,.25); transition: transform .3s ease, border-color .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease; }
    .ai-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: rgba(255,44,255,.7); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,44,255,.1), inset 0 0 28px rgba(255,44,255,.035); }
    .ai-card::after { content:""; position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; height:2px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00eaff,#ff2cff); opacity:.65; }
    .ai-index { color: rgba(255,255,255,.3); font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .15em; }
    .ai-title { margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #00eaff; font-size: clamp(.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .ai-subtitle { margin-top: .35rem; color: #fff; font-size: .8rem; }
    .ai-card p { min-height: 8rem; color: #91aeb8; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.55; }
    .ai-terminal { padding: .55rem .65rem; border-left: 2px solid #ff2cff; color: #d7fbff; background: rgba(255,44,255,.035); font-size: .65rem; line-height: 1.45; }
    .grammar .ai-title { color: #ff2cff; }
    .command .ai-title { color: #ffd34d; }
    .app { border-color: rgba(255,44,255,.45); }
    .app .ai-title { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,44,255,.7); }
    .ai-arrow { align-self: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); font-size: 1.5rem; }

    .ai-boundary { max-width: 1300px; margin: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) auto; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px dashed rgba(0,234,255,.22); background: rgba(0,234,255,.018); text-align: center; }
    .boundary-label { color: #ff2cff; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .2em; }
    .boundary-flow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; font-size: clamp(.65rem, 1vw, .85rem); }
    .boundary-flow strong { color: #eaffff; }
    .boundary-line { width: clamp(18px, 4vw, 60px); border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,234,255,.45); }
    .ai-boundary p { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 850px; color: #829ca6; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }

    .ai-observability { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
    .ai-observability h2 { margin-top: .6rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1.05; }
    .ai-data-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: .6rem; }
    .ai-data-grid div { padding: .8rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,44,255,.18); background: rgba(255,44,255,.025); }
    .ai-data-grid span { display:block; color:#718b94; font-size:.6rem; letter-spacing:.15em; }
    .ai-data-grid strong { display:block; margin-top:.25rem; color:#00eaff; font-size:.75rem; }

    .ai-footer { max-width: 1200px; margin: 5rem auto 0; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; color:#526a73; font-size:.62rem; letter-spacing:.12em; }

    @@media (max-width: 1000px) {
        .ai-pipeline { flex-direction: column; }
        .ai-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
        .ai-card p { min-height: auto; }
        .ai-observability { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @@media (max-width: 650px) {
        .ai-workshop { margin: -.5rem -.75rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; }
        .ai-footer { flex-direction: column; }
    }
</style>
